cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Chiquipoli: interval and exact verification for the local maximality of A16"
abstract: >-
  Interval-arithmetic and exact-rational certification of the first-order
  hypotheses for the Bingane-Audet equilateral small hexadecagon, with a Lean 4
  formalisation of the criterion itself, so that the passage from the certified
  data to strict local maximality is kernel checked end to end.
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/TilinHub/Chiquipoli"
keywords:
  - computer-assisted proof
  - interval arithmetic
  - Lean 4
  - discrete geometry
  - small polygons
